Subject: [PATCH] Tests of the material properties and models of the
 generic-parallel interface

- Material properties on the host (stlpar) and on the device (cuda):
  loading, values given point by point and uniform values, physical
  bounds, statuses for the three out of bounds policies, locations of the
  values, invalid arguments, layout of the output status and version of
  the functions checked against TFEL.
- Model `ode_rk54` integrated as a batch on the host and on the device,
  with a parameter different from its default value.
